      "If you are building a workspace from scratch, adding a vertical mouse is low-cost prevention. The adaptation period is easier to absorb when you are already adjusting to a new desk, chair, and monitor arrangement. Think of it as equivalent to buying an ergonomic chair \u2014 a preventive investment, not a reactive fix.",
      "The Developer or Writer",
