      "Pros and Cons",
      "Wireless Vertical Mouse",
      "Pros:",
      "No cable drag \u2014 preserves the ergonomic vertical angle without counterforce",
      "Multi-device pairing via Bluetooth (up to 3 devices on premium models)",
      "Clean desk setup with no cable management needed",
