      "Wired Vertical Mouse",
      "Pros:",
      "Zero maintenance \u2014 no batteries, no charging, no dongles to lose",
      "Lowest possible latency (<1 ms) for the most responsive feel",
      "Consistent weight \u2014 no battery to change center of gravity",
      "Lowest price entry point ($10\u201315 for budget models)",
      "Perfect connection stability \u2014 no wireless interference possible",
